  "description": "APPLICTION FOR LISTED BUILDING CONSENT IN RESPECT OF THE PROPOSED WORKS TO INSTALL MASONRY PIERS BEHIND THE WALL, ON WITHIN THE MORDEN HALL PARK SITE, TO ADD ADDITIONAL STABILITY TO THE BOUNDARY WALL. THE WALL IS CURRENTLY BULGING TOWARDS THE PUBLIC FOOTPATH OUTSIDE THE PARK. TEMPORARY STEEL SUPPORT SYSTEMS ARE IN PLACE CURRENTLY. THE MASONRY PIERS WILL FORM PERMANENT SUPPORT. ",
